Package: beachmat.zarr
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-11-23
Title: beachmat bindings for Zarr-backed matrices
Description:
    Extends beachmat to support initialization of tatami matrices from Zarr-backed arrays.
    Dense 2-dimensional Zarr arrays (ZarrArray) and compressed sparse matrices stored in the
    AnnData CSR/CSC layout (ZarrSparseMatrix) are read directly from C++, so downstream
    tatami-based code can access them without block processing via DelayedArray.
    Unlike HDF5, Zarr chunks are independent files, so extraction runs in parallel across threads.
Encoding: UTF-8
